Subject: [PATCH] Backport candidate out-of-memory handling to PHP 8.3.35

Status: Candidate for private validation; not confirmed final upstream.
Embargoed: Keep this patch in private repositories until disclosure.

Upstream repository: https://github.com/php/php-src-ghsa-w8hw-w9fx-j79w
Upstream branch: GHSA-h37m-fxqh-w76h-throw-2-fallible-8.3
Upstream base: cb6116aed4de058e552dd24b60c2f50d7275891c
Upstream revision: 07b44b5b3d88c8d8383e2e0a55e2148b78ee291e

This is the complete cumulative diff between the pinned upstream base and
revision, including runtime changes, tests, and test infrastructure. It
does not include the baseline's development-version updates. The diff
applies to the checksum-verified PHP 8.3.35 release source with the
existing Azure Linux patches.

